WEBVTT

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:49.750
--Here we go!

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:52.710
--Three! Two! One!

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:55.210
--Go, Shoot!

00:01:58.180 --> 00:01:59.890
Good going, Takao!

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:01.970
Don't let up, Dragoon!

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:06.480
Cyber Dragoon!

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:12.150
What?!

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:15.820
Look out!

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:35.250
The last battle has finally begun.

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:39.470
With Takao delivering a raging
attack and Kane, on the defensive,

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:43.760
he was able to awaken from
the digital Sacred Beast's spell.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:45.560
Dragoon!

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:54.480
Keep up the attack, Cyber Dragoon!

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:19.510
The two of them were able to battle
without their Sacred Beasts for a little bit...

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:23.090
But the digital Sacred Beast
rose from Kane's Bey,

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:26.970
And Takao summoned Seiryu to counter it.

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:31.890
There it is! Cyber Dragoon
has made its appearance!

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:44.450
And right then, the digital Sacred Beast began to evolve further than we'd imagined!

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:24.700
This little...

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:40.090
The digital Sacred Beast is absorbing all of the high-voltage ions!

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:41.050
--What?

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:50.470
Stop this!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:07.160
Darn!

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:09.990
Stop, Cyber Dragoon!

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:24.090
I will not lose!

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:36.890
Seiryu!

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:38.730
Cut the cheap tricks!

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:41.020
Wait, Max!

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:44.690
This is a battle between Kane and I!

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:47.030
I don't need anyone's help.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:54.700
Go!!

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:03.170
Cyber Dragoon!

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:08.590
Amazing...

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:10.890
Dragoon!

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:15.350
Now!

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.420
What is this wave?

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:57.930
What's going on here?

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.740
This is bad!

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:18.910
The evolved digital Sacred Beast is going to consume this entire room!

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:20.370
What?!

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:23.330
This is some kinda sick joke!

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:24.960
Could it be...?

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:54.820
What is this...?

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:58.330
Reset the monitor!

00:07:58.330 --> 00:07:59.080
Yes, sir!

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:07.920
I can't!

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.970
The digital Sacred Beast...

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:13.340
Has consumed the battle room...

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:17.300
And the control room as well?!

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:20.770
Is this outside of your calculations?

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:22.140
Y-yes...

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:26.940
Please! Stop this battle!

00:08:48.590 --> 00:08:52.380
I control the Sacred Beast and the Bey!!

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:13.740
Oh no!

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.950
It grew again!

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:26.670
What'll happen if
it keeps evolving?

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:28.580
I can't even begin
to imagine...

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:30.920
Isn't there a way
to stop this thing?!

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:35.590
I guess we just have to sit
on our hands and watch...

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:41.600
The Sacred Beast index is increasing rapidly!

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.020
W-what?!

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:49.150
What the heck is it doing?!

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:50.770
Stop! Stop!

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:52.440
Stop!!

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:01.530
Kane!

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:13.880
Kane...

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:16.780
Go get 'em!

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:19.970
That digital Sacred Beast...

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:21.260
Kinomiya...

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:35.190
I will...

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:37.110
Never...

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:40.450
Give into the digital Sacred Beast!

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:42.700
Kane...

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.540
Here I come, Kinomiya!

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.210
Keep attacking!

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:32.790
Don't stop! Run wild, Cyber Dragoon!

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:40.630
I...

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:44.350
I'm not fighting some doll
controlled by the Psykicks!

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:48.640
Kane! I'm fighting against
you! Kane Yamashita!

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:52.060
Like hell I'll be controlled...

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:08.740
Doctor! There's an abnormality in the
storage facility for the four Sacred Beasts!

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:09.870
What?

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:17.920
Why here...?

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:28.470
Damn.

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:33.770
Where the heck is this
control room supposed to be?!

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:01.550
Doctor!

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:05.180
I have no idea...

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:07.470
And you call yourself a scientist?!

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:14.730
If this keeps up, Kane will...

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:18.650
Stop the battle... Stop Kane!!

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:28.700
Salima!

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:38.960
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.010
No matter what...

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:55.640
I will master... the Sacred
Beast and the Bey!

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:58.150
Go, Cyber Dragoon!

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:19.170
Kane...

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:24.670
When the ultimate Blader and the ultimate Sacred Beast team up...

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:27.010
You're about to see what happens!

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.090
Go!!

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:53.950
Get in there, Cyber Dragoon!

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:01.880
Darn!

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:16.220
This is the power of a digital Sacred Beast!

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:23.360
You aren't who I wanna fight!

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:24.520
Take a hike!

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:28.940
Finish him off, Cyber Dragoon!

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:51.550
Seiryu!

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:07.070
The only thing keeping Takao and Seiryu going is their willpower...!

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:21.830
End him, now!

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:26.130
Blast him...!

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:31.170
It's irresponsible to keep going.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:33.840
Takao's body won't hold.

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:36.970
Seiryu may even lose his life...

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:41.310
Let's convince Takao to forfeit.

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:42.140
Yeah.

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:44.440
He won't.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.860
Takao!

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:49.610
Please! You have to forfeit the battle!

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:51.820
What the hell did you just say?

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:56.160
If you keep going, something bad will happen to you or Seiryu!

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:58.780
It takes courage to know
when quit too, Takao!

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:08.540
Let's wrap this up quick, Cyber Dragoon!

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:29.610
You've done enough, Seiryu.

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:31.650
You don't have to fight anymore.

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:33.940
Seiryu! Return to Dragoon!

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:57.720
Seiryu ignored Takao's command!

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:05.730
Seiryu...

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:08.810
Is that it...?

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.190
You haven't...

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:13.690
Given up yet!

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:17.110
Right... I get it!

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:18.860
I get it, now!

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:21.240
I'm not giving up, either!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:24.080
I will never give up!!

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:28.290
Go, Seiryu!!

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:34.050
Seiryu used his own
body to encourage Takao.

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:36.720
That's it! That must be it!

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:39.930
Takao would never give up now!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:43.100
Now you're gonna fight head on!

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:43.970
Yeah.

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:51.150
Seriyu! We're gonna win!!

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:56.570
Kane, stop!

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:00.450
This is no battle!

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:02.820
Isn't that what you told me?

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:03.580
This is dangerous!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:04.740
Let go of me!

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:11.080
Unleash your rage,
Cyber Dragoon!

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:18.050
You just don't know when to quit.

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:39.740
It took over the tower?

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:46.080
The digital Sacred Beast has not only taken
control of the battle room, but the entire tower.

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:49.960
That just has to be
what's going on here.

00:19:56.750 --> 00:20:02.300
I would have never imagined that my
digital Sacred Beast would evolve so much...

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:12.440
Everything is under the control of me and Cyber Dragoon!

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:13.850
So what?

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:16.770
Just because you
controlled the Sacred Beast?

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:17.820
Salima...

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:21.900
Please... Stop this
meaningless battle...

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.070
Out of the way!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:25.660
Remember what you told me?

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:30.540
To cherish the fun of
battling over winning?

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:32.960
Are you really
enjoying this battle?

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:36.380
I just can't think
that you are...

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:38.880
I thought I told you
to get out of the way!

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:40.960
I won't move no matter
what you say!

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:44.510
Then I'll make you!

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:46.430
Cyber Dragoon!

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:52.980
Salima!

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:56.100
Go, Cyber Dragoon!

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:07.740
How can you do
that to your friend?

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:12.200
I won't forgive anyone
who hurts their friends!

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:15.370
You're going down!
That's a promise!

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:16.330
Come on!

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:18.790
Go, Dragoon!

00:22:58.890 --> 00:23:03.860
Kane, under the spell of the digital Sacred Beast, delivers an unrelenting blow to an injured Dragoon.

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:06.280
It's a bad situation!

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:08.110
Can Takao and Seiryu win?

00:23:08.110 --> 00:23:11.320
And what of Ozma's team,
who went after Genbu?

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:14.580
And, uh, oh! I forgot
about the Chairman!

00:23:14.580 --> 00:23:16.580
Everything ends here!

00:23:16.580 --> 00:23:21.170
Will this be a dramatic finish? Be sure to watch next week too, everyone!
